---

(Java) The { ... } part in class Sub extends Sup { ... }, can be conceptually viewed as a ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/mixin.td")} specifically applied to Sup.

(Java) The `\{ ... \}` part in `class Sub extends Sup \{ ... \}`, can be conceptually viewed as a Mixin specifically applied to `Sup`.
